WEBVTT

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:35.520
"Battle of Ceres"

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.900
Initiate the tactical
heavy laser system!

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:37.290
Fire!

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:39.450
But it hasn't fully charged yet!

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.120
I don't care! Fire!

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:48.420
And here I was gonna show off!
Why were we put on reserve?

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.660
I've got the usual,

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.460
plus two massive anti-ship
guided missiles,

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:54.710
four racks of high-mobility
guided missiles,

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.470
four mobile mines

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:59.440
and two midrange impact cannons.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.180
Just what are the Wulga anyway?

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.930
You mean "Wulgaru," not "Wulga".

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:08.220
Aren't they mysterious extraterrestrials
that came to invade Earth?

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:11.530
But what do they look like?

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:15.820
Do you think they're all slimy
and have wobbly antennae?

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.800
If they're from space,
they've gotta be monsters!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.520
That's every man's dream.

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:22.920
They could be silicon-based entities.

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.830
Maybe the ships we're fighting
are their true form.

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:29.750
This was left blank in
our files on them...

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.840
You actually read those?

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.080
You're so mean!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.420
Izuru, shut up!

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:36.590
Huh? He's angry at me?

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.430
The operation isn't
supposed to start yet!

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:41.850
Fire!

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:43.140
Fire!

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.360
Well? Did we get them?

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:53.030
It hit our target. Currently
determining its effect.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.910
Change in mass: 0.04.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.330
Change in orbit: 0.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.690
That's absurd!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.530
Check those results!

00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:04.230
I've confirmed an enormous change
in the mass around the target!

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.550
See? I told you!

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.200
The mass is speeding toward
the first line of defense.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:09.960
It's the enemy!

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.810
Incoming report from the
first line of defense!

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.450
Numerous enemy vessels
are headed toward them.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.310
"We are currently under attack!"

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:26.390
What?! That can't be!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.810
Recharge the laser! Be quick about it!

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:30.820
Begin bombarding the enemy!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.260
Didn't we have 25 minutes
before Zero Hour?

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.230
We began preparing for
battle five minutes ago!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.450
The enemy is right in front of you!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:40.790
Just attack the monsters!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:44.190
We have no other choice.
All vessels, begin the assault!

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.870
All vessels, begin firing at Target A.

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.520
Guided sublight speed missiles
will accelerate in ten seconds.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.180
8...

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.350
7...

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:57.390
6...

00:03:57.390 --> 00:03:58.470
5...

00:03:58.470 --> 00:03:59.090
4...

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.220
All missiles have been destroyed!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.610
What?!

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.370
Normal ammo has no effect!

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:09.140
What about the free electron cannons?

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.100
The alarm?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.600
We're starting the operation?
But it's too soon!

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:15.450
Stupid! The enemy took us by surprise.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.560
Orders to sortie?

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.480
Not yet.

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.570
We need to be ready to leave
as soon as they come in.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:22.160
We're starting the operation early!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.490
All units, prepare to blast off!

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.100
The situation doesn't look good.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.480
The enemy has broken past
the first line of defense

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.470
and is currently headed
straight for our second line.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.700
The free electron cannons are worthless!

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:57.700
What's that mean?

00:04:57.700 --> 00:05:00.530
The free electron beams are curving
around the enemies' magnetic fields.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:03.790
The enemy carriers are equipped
with defensive magnetic fields.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.870
That should make them easy to track.

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:09.420
The Wulgaru probably don't care
if we know where they are.

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:13.130
Aren't they bursting with confidence?
And here we vastly outnumber them.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.540
Considering the situation,
numbers don't matter...

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.460
What situation?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.080
How is it going?!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:20.350
Not good!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.890
The second line of defense's
attacks have no effect!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.880
We have lost over 40% of
the first line of defense!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.120
Send out anyone you can!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.100
Oh, yeah! Don't we have some reserves?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.610
So it's finally our turn, huh?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:38.130
I was getting tired of
holding your reins back.

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:39.820
No one asked ya to!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:42.150
Now then, everyone, let's head out.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:44.200
Team Doberman is taking off!

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.450
I was gonna say that!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.170
All units, take off!

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.990
Don't let the enemy near Ceres
until the laser has finished recharging.

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:52.630
Roger!

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:53.050
Let's go!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.050
Asagi, slow down!

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.300
Stay in formation.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.760
What's wrong with you?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.060
Wait! Wait up!

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.000
I'm counting on you.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.730
<All vessels, take the
Shahaa Formation.>

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.300
<Lay them to waste!>

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.910
The 1st and 3rd Mobile Strike Forces
are down by 45%.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.740
The 27th and 102nd FA Squadrons
have been obliterated!

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:28.700
The 28th and 43rd FA Squadrons
are no longer fit to fight.

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:31.410
The enemy has broken through
the first line of defense!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:33.090
The enemy will reach us in-

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:35.380
Where'd they come from?!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.340
They've destroyed the Wilber and Lassen!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.380
Anzio has been hit!

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.010
We're no longer receiving
its distress signal!

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.550
Hurry and attack the enemy!

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:44.500
Roger! Relay to all vessels:

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:47.060
When engaging the enemy, set your guns
on full auto and attack anything!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.520
I repeat: Set your guns to full auto
and attack anything!

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.390
Annihilate all of our foes!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.220
Damn it!

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:57.970
What in the-?!

00:06:58.530 --> 00:06:59.350
Tally ho!

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.410
The cavalry has arrived!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.580
If it weren't for you, we would
have gotten here quicker!

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:05.780
You're blaming me?!

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.490
This is Team Doberman.
We are here to offer our support.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.250
Hey, Patrick! Don't steal the best
line right from under me!

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.040
I'm sorry, Sir.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.410
It's the Comedic Three...
I'm sorry, Sir.

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.180
All vessels, retreat to Point Mike!

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:23.680
Now is our chance to regroup!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.550
Roger!

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:34.400
The enemy is retreating.

00:07:34.690 --> 00:07:35.750
Amazing!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.100
I can't believe Team Doberman
was capable of all that!

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.810
Crap! A carrier's coming!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:46.820
The magnetic field-!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:49.940
It...!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:51.450
The beams curved?!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.030
Wow! They hit the enemy ships
that were hiding behind it!

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.910
They're using the magnetic field

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:58.920
to bend the particle beams
to hit other enemy ships!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:07:59.950
These guys are nuts!

00:08:00.130 --> 00:08:01.410
Is it all that impressive?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.870
They can't be human!

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:06.260
We should give our allies a hand
while they regroup.

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:07.290
What's the plan?

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.220
Kei, do your thing!

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:09.140
Roger!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.890
I've finished analyzing the situation.
I'm sending the data now.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.270
Thanks.

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:18.520
Uh... Gold 4, hook up with the fleet and

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.230
lay down suppressive fire to cover their retreat.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:22.240
Blue 1 and Purple 2, offer him support.

00:08:22.240 --> 00:08:27.870
Uh, Rose 3, well...
umm... You can... Uh...

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.230
Kaboom!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.830
Asagi and I will fight
in the frontlines!

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:35.040
Kei, analyze the situation and
issue orders as you will!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:37.540
Tamaki... is fine as she is.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:39.660
Roger!

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.500
Roger!

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:57.730
<That is...>

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:01.280
<It is time I set out!>

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.360
<The enemy has clearly
laid a trap before us!>

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:07.480
<A trap? Then I will tear through it.
Come or be left behind!>

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:14.900
High-speed objects are
approaching the minefield!

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.610
What?!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:26.290
The high-speed objects are
approaching from dead space.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:28.720
Red 5, please intercept them.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.600
Huh? But...

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.810
That's an order from your commanding office!
Where's your response?!

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:33.800
Yes, Ma'am! Red 5 will intercept!

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:35.480
Asagi, you handle things here.

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.300
You can count on me!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:41.310
Red 5 is proceeding to intercept
the high-speed objects.

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.020
He will reach them in 10 minutes!

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:48.350
Why'd it suddenly stop?

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:51.270
It's moving on its own!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:57.610
It's that white fighter!

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.120
<I've found you, my prey!>

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:11.500
<You have improved!>

00:10:12.640 --> 00:10:14.220
Does he have eyes in
the back of his head?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.260
<Petty decoys will not work on me!>

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:25.270
How about this?!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.860
<A waste of time!>

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.120
Over there!

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.160
That didn't even touch him?

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:35.860
Moron!

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:38.210
Stupid! Stupid! You're in my way!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.580
It's big!

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.560
You twit! Stay outta my line of fire!

00:10:46.560 --> 00:10:47.840
Don't detonate on impact!

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.960
Damn! Those are 2 hundred million each!

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.500
There are too many of them!

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:57.090
What happened to Izuru?!

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:59.310
He is currently fighting in dead space.

00:10:59.310 --> 00:11:00.600
I know that!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.010
Then don't ask!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:05.640
<Out of my way!>

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.390
He killed his comrade?!

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.440
<You had best not divert
your attention!>

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:16.900
I have to do something!

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.010
Red 5 has commenced
battle in dead space.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.530
Team Rabbits is also in the
midst of battle, but...

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:26.670
What's wrong?

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:28.240
Speak clearly when making your report.

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:30.670
Everyone is acting independently.
There isn't any semblance of teamwork.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.960
Bluntly put, they suck.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.590
So Izuru was doing a surprisingly
good job leading them, huh?

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:37.920
Guys, are you okay?

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.350
Izuru?! Of... of course we are!

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.100
After all, I'm giving the orders.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.090
What a relief!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.070
I've got my hands full
with some crazy strong bogie over here.

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.950
Asagi, you're the leader.
Look after everyone!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:52.600
Leader...

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:55.690
That's right! I'm the leader!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.460
What's this?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:03.500
Is it from Kei?

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.290
That's it! Kei!

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:07.830
Summarize the situation for me! Please!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.530
The enemy units are located...

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:12.260
If I mess this up,

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.860
Irina and the girls are going to
tease me again when I get back!

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:18.700
I've got to do my best!

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:21.300
Open all sensors to maximum reception.

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.610
I am displaying their
location on Secret Code F.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.480
The enemy's main forces are moving

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:35.440
from 13CM to 13IC at a speed of 45.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.480
The enemies from GK to BF are decoys.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.370
Tamaki, move from FF
to EI at full speed.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:43.830
Ten seconds thereafter,
launch all of your missiles

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:45.200
and swing over to EK.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:49.240
Uh, I don't really get
it, but you've got it!

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.460
Suruga, defend our flagship while

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.460
driving the enemies into Point EH.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.460
You can count on me!

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:59.090
Kei, set up a trap at EH minus Tango.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:00.460
Roger!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.760
Enemy units are approaching the
remaining ships in the frontline!

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.230
They have destroyed 24% of our convoy!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:11.810
Over 400 new enemy units are appearing
from Point OM, Sector 3!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:12.940
Wha-?!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:22.040
Kaboooom!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.370
Is anyone seriously
gonna come out this way?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.830
Firing 90mm high-quality particle beams
at the target point!

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.830
Take all of my high-mobility guided
missiles while you're at it!

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.720
Sweet!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:48.060
Asagi, go to your assigned position.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:48.760
Roger!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.800
Yikes! Move! Move!

00:13:51.110 --> 00:13:52.510
Tamaki, fire all of your ammo!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:53.220
You've got it!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:01.900
I got them good!

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:07.910
We rock!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.490
The enemy is sending reinforcements!

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.670
They'll have the upper hand
in a close-range battle.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:13.870
All units, defend the flagship
as we slowly pull back!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.660
Roger!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.080
I've gotta lighten my load!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:27.340
<Hmmm, what an intriguing idea.
That is what makes you my prey!>

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.770
Blue 1 has taken the lead
and stabilized the situation.

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:33.680
The fleet has begun to retreat.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.600
Red 5 is stalling the
enemy in dead space.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.770
I guess things are working out...

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:41.700
Gold 4 is almost completely
out of ammunition.

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:43.830
The other units are still able to fight.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:46.120
I see. Have Gold 4 retreat and-

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.410
This is Gold 4.

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:49.340
We're switching to a
close-to-midrange battle.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:50.950
I need a heavy laser for my main arm

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:52.760
and a close-range particle
diffusion cannon,

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:54.590
a MIRV launcher and a scatter impact

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:56.290
cannon for my sub weapons.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.800
This is Mother Bird. You've got it.

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:00.090
Hurry on back.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:01.200
It looks like they're

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.530
finally starting to get a
grasp on their units, huh?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.210
Gold 4 has always been
a weapons encyclopedia.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.200
Izuru, we're doing fine on our end.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.150
We're retreating to the
third line of defense.

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:15.100
It's not easy being leader!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.020
Then I can't afford to lose here!

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.350
I can see it!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:27.690
<Excellent! Just what I would expect
from one that has managed to strike me!>

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:31.830
<Through hunting, the prey
and the hunter communicate!>

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.790
<We predict each other's
moves, constantly

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.340
reading one step beyond the next.>

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:36.840
<We fight desperately, trying
to outwit the other!>

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.010
<I'm enjoying you, infidel!>

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:41.800
Damn it! I'm still not fast enough.

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:47.900
Bingo!

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:49.520
We're ready to outfit
it just like you wanted!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.390
It looks like you finally understand
the teachings of Muscle-dom!

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:54.970
With these muscles, swapping your
armament'll only take a second!

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:58.140
Man, could you quit
going on about muscles?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:01.310
Moron! The world is made from
weapons and muscles!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:05.560
Have some protein!

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:07.980
Seriously, gimme a break...

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:12.920
Finished swapping his armament!

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:13.790
Finished replenishing supplies!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:14.620
He's all set!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.130
Blast off!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:17.030
Roger!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:35.340
What is the situation?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:38.350
Currently 76% of our remaining
forces are converging

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.390
around the third line of defense.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:41.730
They are regrouping.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.260
The Bela-Russian and
Great Chinese fleets

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.810
have broken from the battle.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.780
Did they suffer heavy losses?

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:49.480
They weren't horrible.

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:53.150
I imagine they are reserving
their forces for future battles.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.000
There... Zoom in on Red 5.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:56.570
Roger!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.210
What's he doing?

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.500
It looks like he's in quite the fight.

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:03.350
He's putting tremendous strain on Red 5.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.310
Pull up all of the data on Red 5!

00:17:05.310 --> 00:17:07.500
Roger! I'll put it on the main screen.

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:13.470
A duel? Why isn't he using his guns?

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.390
It looks like his opponent is too fast.

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:18.000
The JURIA-SYSTEM is already
working at full capacity.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.180
Is his enemy that powerful?

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:22.960
Yes, he's a fearsome foe...

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.600
We'll need to figure out how to deal with him.

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:27.150
Tamaki, Kei, go replenish your supplies!

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:27.950
Roger!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:28.700
But-!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.830
Suruga and I can handle things here!

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:32.040
Be careful.

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:33.880
Tryin' to act all cool!

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.460
You bet! You've got my back.

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:45.470
Suruga, can you keep up with me?

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:47.470
Who do you think I am?

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.660
Great. Let's go!

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:56.440
Well?

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.180
Five minutes until it activates!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:17:59.730
You can make it back
to the Pit, can't you?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:00.680
Get going!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.230
Who do you think you're ordering around?

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.280
He who has run out of
"Otto" and "Herman"

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.610
has no right to complain!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:07.390
What the heck?

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:08.770
That's what the army

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.450
used to call fuel and
ammunition a long time ago!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.000
Just say it like a normal person, idiot!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.080
Screw that!

00:18:14.080 --> 00:18:15.360
This is part of what makes my identity!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.210
What're you doing?!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.500
You scared me...

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.320
Hurry up!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.730
I finished stocking up! Asagi, hurry up!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:23.320
That won't be necessary.
We'll send the supplies to you instead.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.910
Huh? Don't tell me you're going to...!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.340
We're firing the supplies,
so catch them!

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:29.030
Wait a sec! I stink
at this merging stuff!

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:36.560
Here I go!

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:41.230
Regrouping: Complete.

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:43.720
All squadrons, gather around
the third line of defense!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.300
Has it recharged yet?

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:45.890
Just finished.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:48.660
I will begin the firing sequence.

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:50.760
Count down:

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:52.740
60...

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:53.780
59...

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:54.820
58...

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.420
9...

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:09.470
8...

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:10.510
7...

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:10.960
6...

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:12.470
5...

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:13.430
4...

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.560
3...

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.470
2...

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.350
1...

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:17.590
Fire!

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:27.470
Did we get them?!

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:35.830
What is it?!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:37.580
There are enemy vessels
above the beam cannon!

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:38.370
What?!

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.240
They didn't appear on the radar earlier!

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:41.660
It's the enemy!

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:42.820
<Now!>

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.200
Crap! We're in a Catch-22!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:49.460
I'll plot a navigation route!
Give me 10 seconds.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:51.210
I'll have it in five.

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:52.220
What?

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.330
I'm sending you the data.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:59.050
All right, men! Charge!

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:09.540
Amazing!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:12.690
Most impressive, my dears.
Care to go on a date with me later?

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:13.810
Huh?

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.340
I'll have to pass.

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.720
Could you try to be serious
every now and then?

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.440
Um, is he always like this?

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.540
Of course not!

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:21.750
Yeah, he is.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:22.820
Why you little...!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:23.920
I'll whack you!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:24.750
Hey!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:41.420
Our tactical heavy laser
has been destroyed!

00:20:40.520 --> 00:20:42.180
Incompetent fools!

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:44.640
You've made a mess of my perfect plan!

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:47.550
Arms and legs are supposed to do
as the head tells them!

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:57.100
<That's right. A hunt that
lacks dignity and respect

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:59.100
is merely a massacre.>

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:01.780
<It is without any sense of beauty!>

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:15.750
<En garde!>

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:50.030
<This duel was amusing.
Let us fight again, primitive creature!>

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:02.200
I'm sure he looked human...

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.230
And he could even talk!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:06.720
I never expected our
enemy to be like this...

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:10.930
He resembled that girl.

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:55.910
"Disclosure"
